      "body": "**T12 session 0067: rank-e stratum LANDS sorry-free \u2014 new `AlgebraicJacobian/Picard/EntryIdealStratum.lean` (806 LOC, axiom-clean, build green 8584 jobs).**\n\nThe geometric core of the n=0 universal flattening stratification is built (commits b90ff8e19a, 26ac8c7f60, fbd9636441). For any scheme X and quasi-coherent G with e-presentation charts covering X (`ChartsCover`): the strata ideal (iInf of entry-ideal comaps over charts) with chart evaluation (presentation-independence engine) and **quasi-coherence** `map_strataIdeal_basicOpen` (finite chart covers from affine compactness \u2014 no noetherian hypothesis \u2014 + mk'-denominator clearing); `strataData : X.IdealSheafData`, `stratum`/`stratum\u03b9` **IsClosedImmersion** (free from Mathlib), and `mem_range_stratum\u03b9_iff`: support = rank-e locus via the new chart-independent `pointRank` (fiberRank base-change invariance without flatness) + point\u2194prime dictionary. All key decls #print-axioms clean: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound].\n\n**Remaining for `flatLocusStratification_universal` (GenericFlatnessGeometric.lean:2045, statement unchanged, still the 1 deliberate sorry):** (D1) factorization through the stratum via IsClosedImmersion.lift + relMatrix_eq_zero_of_flat on pullback_app_isoTensor-transported presentations; (D2) flatness of the stratum pullback via flat_section_of_affine_cover; (E) clopen rank decomposition of T + Sigma assembly + instantiation at X := (union of charts W_e). Full route with exact Mathlib lemma names in memory `t12-rank-stratum-landed`; est. 1-2 focused sessions.\n\n**Debts:** (1) blueprint nodes for the ~25 new decls (new subsection of Picard_FlatteningStratification.tex) not written \u2014 needs a blueprint pass; (2) two benign linter warnings (unused \u2203-binder name Pc). New v4.31 wall recipes (congrArg+Eq.mp beats rw/\u25b8 on mk' terms; canonical OreLocalization base-algebra instances \u2014 never letI toAlgebra-comp for residue fields) in mem